  "goodToKnow": "Die Jungfrau means virgin: die Jungfrau Maria. It's also the star sign Virgo: Sie ist Jungfrau. Originally it simply meant young woman (jung + Frau); the old form Jungfer survives in die alte Jungfer (old maid, dated) and die Jungfernfahrt (maiden voyage). Die Jungfrau is also a famous 4,158-metre mountain in the Swiss Alps, reached by Europe's highest railway station, the Jungfraujoch."
